'''Glacite''', pronounced [ɡlˈeɪsˈaɪt]<ref>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uGZJjdTxuBs&t=24</ref>, is a {{Common}} resource in the {{Skill|Mining}} Collection that can be obtained in the {{Zone|Glacite Tunnels}} and {{Zone|Glacite Mineshafts}} by mining Glacite veins.

== Collection ==
Collecting '''Glacite''' increases the player's Glacite [[collections|collection]], which grants useful items and perks upon collecting certain amounts of Glacite.

{{/Collection UI}}
{{CollectionTable|Glacite}}

== Obtaining ==
=== Mining ===
'''Glacite''' is obtained by mining {{Item|Packed Ice}} in the {{Zone|Glacite Tunnels}} or {{Zone|Glacite Mineshafts}}. It requires {{Stat|Breaking Power|9}} to mine.

